COPY DATA

1) IF U WANT TO COPY ALL FILES IN A FOLDER -> USE Wildcard file path IN File path type INSIDE SOURCE. THEN PUT * IN THE WILDCARD FILE NAME, THIS WILL COPY ENTIRE FILES IN THE FOLDER.
2) IF U WANT TO COPY SPECIFIC FILES STARTING WITH SAME NAMES -> EXAMPLE SALES*.* ->.* MEANS ANY EXTENSION
3) IF U WANT TO COPY FILES WITH SPECFIC EXTENSTION-> *.CSV

